Body:
For anyone still struggling, the issue is that you need to include project ID, as follows:
```
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "supabase": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://mcp.supabase.com/mcp?project_ref={insert_project_id}",
    }
  }
}
```

// opencode.json                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
"qwen3.6-plus": {                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  "name": "Qwen3.6 Plus",                                                                                                                                                                                                           
  "reasoning": true,                                                                                                                                                                                                                
  "status": "beta",                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
  "provider": {                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    "api": "https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1"                                                                                                                                                                                          
  }                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
}

workaround: you can add this config to opencode.json (inside the **provider** block). i can call with this (go plan). then choose /models again in opencode.
``` json
    "custom": {
      "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",
      "options": {
        "baseURL": "https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1",
        "apiKey": "your-key-here"
      },
      "models": {
        "qwen3.6-plus": {
          "name": "qwen3.6-plus"
        }
      }
    }
```
